<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6840" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακυκλ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turn round again,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακύκλει δέμας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					231
				</span></i>
			; <i>revolve in one's mind,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ἐμαυτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Nigr.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			; <i>repeat,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς αὐτοὺς λόγους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Dem.</u>
					29
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mus.</u>
				p.40K.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Herm.
				<u>in Phdr.</u>
				p.191A.
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be renewed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεμος ἐφ᾽ ἑαυτὸν -ούμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procop.
					<u>Arc.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr. in 
				Act.
			, <i>come round in a circle,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GC</u>
				338a4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ αὐταὶ δόξαι ἀ. ἐν τοῖς ἀνθρώποις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					339b29
				</span></i>
			:—so in 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πρὸς αὑτήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					37a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ τύχαι πολλάκις ἀ. περὶ τοὺς
					αὐτούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1100b3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
